to steal your pizzas for viral videos.<br></li><li>Meteors(?)<br></li><li>Aliens(????)</li></ul><br><i>Avoid the natural hazards of the job!</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996780/extras/4cfd78643f0422e3f80768d02ca73306.poster.avif?t=1659121912\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996780/extras/4cfd78643f0422e3f80768d02ca73306.webm?t=1659121912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996780/extras/4cfd78643f0422e3f80768d02ca73306.mp4?t=1659121912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
